  "story": {
    "title": "Pip's First Word",
    "bgm": "b2_u5_story",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u05_1",
        "desc": "A bright morning at the Word Pond. Eight rows of round stepping stones now reach to the middle of the pond, each stone faintly marked with a small picture of its word (a cat, a hat, a can, a fan...). Bun walks ahead counting the stones on her paw; Hedgie follows with his red backpack; Beads rides on Hedgie's flower; the orange cat, the brown hen and the puppy follow in a line. Pip hops from stone to stone. Hidden in the picture: the cat, the cat's red hat on a stone, a tin can, the fan. Grumble does NOT appear.",
        "hidden": [
          "cat",
          "hat",
          "can",
          "fan"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "The cat and the hen!",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l1"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Cat, hat, bat, mat, rat!",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l2"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "Click-clack! Can, fan, pan, van!",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l3"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u05_2",
        "desc": "Pip stands alone on the cat stone in the middle of the pond with its eyes squeezed shut and feathers trembling, beak open, trying with all its might; Beads sits in front of Pip on the water holding up three beads one at a time; Bun and Hedgie hold their breath on the next stone with paws over their mouths; the cat watches hopefully from the bank. Hidden in the picture: Bun's blue cap, Hedgie's red bag, the map, the butterfly net. Grumble does NOT appear.",
        "hidden": [
          "cap",
          "bag",
          "map",
          "net"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Tac... tac...",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l4"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/k/... /æ/... /t/...",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l5"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Pip tries. Pip tries.",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l6"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u05_3",
        "desc": "Pip has said its first word: it stands tall on the cat stone with its beak wide open, glowing bright gold with sparkles bursting all around; the orange cat leaps high into the air with joy; Bun and Hedgie jump and cheer with arms up; Beads clicks all its beads together in a happy arc. Water drops sparkle. Hidden in the picture: the hen on a stone, a blue pen in the hen's beak, Grumble's little red bed on the bank. Grumble does NOT appear.",
        "hidden": [
          "hen",
          "pen",
          "bed"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Cat! Cat! CAT!",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l7"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Pip can read! Cat!",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l8"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "Click-clack! Cat!",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l9"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b2_u05_1"
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u05_4",
        "desc": "Dusk, the sky deep blue. The friends walk back along the stepping stones, which are lit from the side by a warm light: Grumble stands at the edge of the reeds holding his lantern up high, and its glow stretches across the water onto the stones; his face is calm and he whispers with a tiny smile. Bun waves at him; Hedgie carries the sleepy cat; Pip glows softly on Hedgie's head. Hidden in the picture: Grumble's bandaged leg, the peg on the washing line, the red blanket on the little bed.",
        "hidden": [
          "leg",
          "peg",
          "red"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "The lantern is on.",
            "audio": "b2_u05_l10"
